  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "0f7e0138-ed9d-479d-a475-f291838a2383",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "We can start interpreting the results by looking at a volcano plot of the results. We will show all events in this plot, and color them by the receiving cell (indicated as `ct1`)."
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": 34,
   "id": "1921c498-25b9-4305-95da-50707051e0a4",
   "metadata": {
    "tags": []
   },
   "outputs": [
    {
     "data": {
      "image/png": "",
      "text/plain": [
       "<Figure size 600x500 with 1 Axes>"
      ]
     },
     "metadata": {},
     "output_type": "display_data"
    }
   ],
   "source": [
    "# creating a volcano plot\n",
    "plt.figure(figsize=(6, 5))\n",
    "for ct, color in col_celltype.items():\n",
    "    sub = de_results[de_results[\"ct1\"] == ct]\n",
    "    plt.scatter(sub[\"log2FC\"], -np.log10(sub[\"pval\"]), c=color, label=ct, alpha=0.6, s=10)\n",
    "plt.axvline(0, color=\"grey\", linestyle=\"--\")\n",
    "plt.xlabel(\"log2FC\")\n",
    "plt.ylabel(\"-log10(p-value)\")\n",
    "plt.legend(markerscale=2)\n",
    "plt.title(\"Volcano plot of spatial DE\")\n",
    "plt.show()"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "e175af06-12d5-46c4-8659-9f82a0c3fef1",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
